        "outputs": "{items:[{id,revision,openTime,endTime,open,high,low,close,volume,isClosed,closure}],nextCursor?,metadata:{seriesId,instrument,spec,coverage,snapshotId,consistency,meta,connection?}}；OHLC 是十进制字符串，volume 自带单位/未知状态；无 nextCursor 只说明本次快照分页结束。",
